OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be another dry day with
OL,6,Fa cloudy start, but bright and sunny
OL,7,Fspells breaking through the cloud to
OL,8,Fgive longer sunny periods in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will stay dry through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with increasing
OL,13,Fclear spells developing, which will
OL,14,Fallow areas of frost and fog to form.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA chilly start with any fog
OL,17,Fslow to clear. Otherwise dry with
OL,18,Fvariable cloud interspersed with
OL,19,Fbright and sunny spells. Areas of fog
OL,20,Fdeveloping again in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
